    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add potatoes, paneer, salt, red chilli powder, chaat masala, crushed black pepper, coriander leaves and green chillies. Mix well till a smooth dough like mixture is formed.",
      "Set aside till in use.",
      "Add grated Pizza Cheese to a bowl along with oregano, chilli flakes and black olives. Mix well.",
      "Take the potato mixture, fill cheese in between and give it a cylindrical shape. Keep aside till further use.",
      "Take the bread, dip it in water, cover the prepared mixture with bread and make an oval shape.",
      "Once all are prepared, set them in the refrigerator to cool down for about 30-40 minutes.",
      "Heat oil in a kadhai, deep-fry the prepared cheese bread rolls till golden brown and crisp.",
      "Drain on absorbent paper.",
      "Serve with tomato ketchup or choice of dip."
    ],
